WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.870
Five Claude Code sessions.
One of them is waiting for you.

00:00:04.450 --> 00:00:07.820
Atelier puts them all in one window,
sorted by what they need.

00:00:08.700 --> 00:00:12.580
Every action is a shortcut away,
and Command K finds the rest.

00:00:13.250 --> 00:00:15.810
Your terminals live right beside your sessions.

00:00:16.800 --> 00:00:20.020
Browse your project,
and edit files without leaving Claude.

00:00:20.450 --> 00:00:24.300
Automations turn your Jira, ClickUp
or Notion tasks into sessions,

00:00:24.300 --> 00:00:25.820
each in its own worktree.

00:00:26.860 --> 00:00:27.710
Plus Git.

00:00:27.930 --> 00:00:28.690
Docker.

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:30.660
And Redis, one click away.

00:00:31.340 --> 00:00:33.530
Close the app. Your sessions keep going.

00:00:34.940 --> 00:00:36.560
Atelier. Never lose track.
